      "extractedText": "Republic of the Philippines\nB\nProvince of Iloilo\nH\nM\nMUNICIPALITY OF MIAGAO\nA\nBIDS AND AWARDS COMMITTEE\nwebsite : www.miagao.gov.ph\nemail address: Igumiagao@yahoo.com\nINVITATION TO BID FOR THE CONSTRUCTION/REPAIR OF\nCDC (CHILD DEVELOPMENT CENTER),\nBRGY. SAN RAFAEL, MIAGAO, ILOILO\n1.\nThe Municipality of Miagao through the Budget for the Contract Approved by the\nSanggunian, Trust Fund DSWD, Budget Year 2019 intends to apply the sum of P\n263,340.00 being the Approved Budget for the Contract (ABC) to payments under the\ncontract for Supply and Delivery of Materials and Supplies for the\nConstruction/Repair of CDC (Child Development Center), Brgy. San Rafael, Miagao,\nIloilo. Bids received in excess of the ABC shall be automatically rejected at bid\nopening.\n2.\nThe Municipality of Miagao now invites bids for the following:\nITEM\nNO.\nQUANTITY\nUNIT\nITEM DESCRIPTION\n1\n320\nbags\nportland cement\n2\n25\ncu.m.\nwashed gravel\n3\n27\ncu.m.\nwashed sand\n4\n270\npcs\n10mm x 6.0m steel bars\n5\n30\npcs\n12mm x 6.0m steel bars\n6\n40\npcs\n16mm x 6.0m steel bars\n7\n1400\npcs\n6\" concrete hollow blocks\n8\n320\npcs\n4\" concrete hollow blocks\n9\n15\npcs\n1/4\" x 4' x 8' ordinary plywood\n10\n240\npcs\n2\" x 2\" x 10' good lumber, rough\n11\n40\npcs\nbamboo poles, 4\" Ø, more or less 30 ft.\n12\n30\nkgs\n#16 GI tie wire\n13\n8\nkgs\n1 1/2\" common wire nails\n14\n8\nkgs\n2 1/2\" common wire nails\n15\n20\nkgs\n3\" common wire nails\n16\n10\nkgs\n4\" common wire nails\n17\n10\nkgs\n5\" common wire nails\n18\n15\npcs\nhacksaw blade\nDelivery of the Goods is required fifteen (15) calendar days after receipt of Notice to\nProceed. Bidders should have completed within twelve (12) months, a contract\nsimilar to the Project from the date of submission and receipt of bids. The description\nof an eligible bidder is contained in the Bidding Documents, particularly, in Section II.\nInstructions to Bidders.\n1",
      "ocrText": "Republic of the Philippines\nB\nProvince of Iloilo\nH\nM\nMUNICIPALITY OF MIAGAO\nA\nBIDS AND AWARDS COMMITTEE\nwebsite : www.miagao.gov.ph\nemail address: Igumiagao@yahoo.com\nINVITATION TO BID FOR THE CONSTRUCTION/REPAIR OF\nCDC (CHILD DEVELOPMENT CENTER),\nBRGY. SAN RAFAEL, MIAGAO, ILOILO\n1.\nThe Municipality of Miagao through the Budget for the Contract Approved by the\nSanggunian, Trust Fund DSWD, Budget Year 2019 intends to apply the sum of P\n263,340.00 being the Approved Budget for the Contract (ABC) to payments under the\ncontract for Supply and Delivery of Materials and Supplies for the\nConstruction/Repair of CDC (Child Development Center), Brgy. San Rafael, Miagao,\nIloilo. Bids received in excess of the ABC shall be automatically rejected at bid\nopening.\n2.\nThe Municipality of Miagao now invites bids for the following:\nITEM\nNO.\nQUANTITY\nUNIT\nITEM DESCRIPTION\n1\n320\nbags\nportland cement\n2\n25\ncu.m.\nwashed gravel\n3\n27\ncu.m.\nwashed sand\n4\n270\npcs\n10mm x 6.0m steel bars\n5\n30\npcs\n12mm x 6.0m steel bars\n6\n40\npcs\n16mm x 6.0m steel bars\n7\n1400\npcs\n6\" concrete hollow blocks\n8\n320\npcs\n4\" concrete hollow blocks\n9\n15\npcs\n1/4\" x 4' x 8' ordinary plywood\n10\n240\npcs\n2\" x 2\" x 10' good lumber, rough\n11\n40\npcs\nbamboo poles, 4\" Ø, more or less 30 ft.\n12\n30\nkgs\n#16 GI tie wire\n13\n8\nkgs\n1 1/2\" common wire nails\n14\n8\nkgs\n2 1/2\" common wire nails\n15\n20\nkgs\n3\" common wire nails\n16\n10\nkgs\n4\" common wire nails\n17\n10\nkgs\n5\" common wire nails\n18\n15\npcs\nhacksaw blade\nDelivery of the Goods is required fifteen (15) calendar days after receipt of Notice to\nProceed. Bidders should have completed within twelve (12) months, a contract\nsimilar to the Project from the date of submission and receipt of bids. The description\nof an eligible bidder is contained in the Bidding Documents, particularly, in Section II.\nInstructions to Bidders.\n1",
